direction: down
title: "C23 NR in-flight custody and resolver validation-pin handoff"
"Queued node" -> "Pre-pop stable escrow": "prepare/register before queue ownership disappears"
"Pre-pop stable escrow" -> "Token operation": "one invocation-bound attempt; unknown retains opaque responsibility"
"Token operation" -> "Node release operation": "token completion receipt before last-use pool return"
"Node release operation" -> "Done publication": "known node receipt then release escrow; not a free-effect guess"
"Live resolver lock" -> "Validated candidate": "generation/mapping check while exclusive authority held"
"Validated candidate" -> "Pinned record": "acquire pin before unlock/address exposure"
"Close/reclaim lock" -> "Closed record gate": "existing pins survive; new lookups denied"
"No record pins" -> "Record retirement": "also exact completion/sender/raw route closure"
"No anchor readers" -> "Generation reuse": "exclusive update; old typed ID refused before record access"
